# genuine stock SWF is available to run generate_diffs.py against for real,
# reference/RaceMenu/diffs/*.as.diff (the one artifact meant to ship) does
# not exist yet, and tests/cmake/RaceMenuWeightSyncStaticSafety.cmake plus
# tools/BuildRaceMenuSwf.ps1 both still need these files. Untrack them in
